## Dimensional model

Serve measurements at an explicit grain through facts and descriptive dimensions.

- **Periodic snapshot facts** — FACT_METER_READS and FACT_GENERATION_OUTPUT use agreed grains.
- **Descriptive dimensions** — Meter, customer, tariff and asset attributes.
- **Surrogate-key joins** — Each fact references one appropriate dimension version.
- **Unresolved keys** — Use a defined unknown member or held fact; avoid silent row loss.

**Consumption contract:** Dimension joins must preserve fact counts and measurement totals.
